capability fs/walk  every path under a folder, depth first, each folder's entries by name
  heroes  fs.walk, fs.walk_following_links, fs.walk_to_depth
  go      filepath.Walk, filepath.WalkDir, filepath.WalkFunc, filepath.SkipDir
  rust    -
  python  os.walk, os.fwalk, Path.walk
